OL,3,AConservatives must be ready to fight
OL,4,A'battle of ideas', Badenoch to tell
OL,5,Aparty conference
OL,6,
OL,7,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch will
OL,8,Faddress her party's conference in
OL,9,FBirmingham later this morning, where
OL,10,Fshe'll commit the Tories to fighting a
OL,11,F"battle for the soul of the nation"
OL,13,FShe's expected to say the differences
OL,14,Fbetween her party and the Labour
OL,15,Fgovernment go "to the very core of what
OL,16,Fkind of country we want to be"
OL,18,FThe party has pledged #10bn for a UK
OL,19,Fair defence system, and proposed cuts
OL,20,Fto employer National Insurance
OL,21,Fcontributions for workers aged 21 to 24
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
